// 012.3 / 011.11 / D10: a Scenario may carry `From CLAUSE "span"`, verified against the clause, and an Acceptance span may name a declared Scenario.
Fact actor Identified by Ada
Fact done Identified by actor
Act work Actor actor Holds when True Creates done(actor)
